            "type": "TEXT",
            "data": "/opt/spark/python/pyspark/sql/pandas/conversion.py:659: FutureWarning: PySpark does not yet fully support pandas >= 3.0.0. Some features may not work correctly. It is recommended to use pandas < 3.0.0 for now.\n  require_minimum_pandas_version()\n/opt/spark/python/pyspark/sql/pandas/conversion.py:936: FutureWarning: PySpark does not yet fully support pandas >= 3.0.0. Some features may not work correctly. It is recommended to use pandas < 3.0.0 for now.\n  require_minimum_pandas_version()\n+-----------+---------+-------------------+----------------+\n|temperatura|vibracion|distancia_al_centro|es_anomalia_real|\n+-----------+---------+-------------------+----------------+\n|       95.0|      2.1| 44.521072652978354|            true|\n|       88.0|      8.5|  38.07014950348721|            true|\n+-----------+---------+-------------------+----------------+\n\n"
